<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection (Mus musculus (embryonic E11-E15 mouse bronchial tree))",
        "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection faithfully reproduces Mus musculus (embryonic E11-E15 mouse bronchial tree) morphology" ;
