<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Metzger et al.'s (2008) 3D orthonormal Bishop/Frenet frame branching grammar for Domain Branching (D), Planar Bifurcation (P, Delta_phi = 0 deg), and Orthogonal Bifurcation (O, Delta_phi = 90 deg), proving the 4m + 1 = 17 active-tip composition law and global 3D clearance optimum at Delta_phi* = 90 deg (+61.9% over Planar and +12.5% over randomized dihedral control, L102-328), alongside Menshykau et al.'s (2012, 2014) FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 receptor-ligand reaction-diffusion dispersion relation and semi-implicit spectral PDE mode switch (L334-465). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 `sorry`s) in `Loop_053_lung_stereotyped_branching_modes.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` reports 8 quantitative morphometrics with reference values, dispersion statistics (RMSE, Pearson r, p-value, SD, CV), and negative-control ablation deltas (L698-776): exact 4m + 1 = 17 active tips, optimal dihedral angle 90.0 deg (+61.88% clearance gain over Planar), transverse isotropy contrast 0.4818, Turing wavelength lambda_T = 1.4229 (equal-diffusion control amplitude 0.00077 vs 2.04), E12.5-E14.5 lineage dihedral RMSE = 1.98 deg (r = 0.9994, p = 5.4e-10), E11.0-E14.5 tip-count Pearson r = 1.0000, segmented specimen junction angle 76.49 ± 14.61 deg (N = 32), and segmented caliber ratio 0.8826 ± 0.1066." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-compound-lobar-scaffold-d-4-o-o-active-distal-tip-count-4m-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-empirical-e11-0-e14-5-developmental-distal-tip-count-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-empirical-e12-5-e14-5-mouse-lung-dihedral-angle-rmse-8-lineages>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-fgf10-shh-ptch1-turing-critical-wavelength-lambda-t>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-optimal-dihedral-rotation-angle-delta-phi-maximizing-3d-inter-tip-clearance>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-planar-vs-orthogonal-transverse-3d-tip-isotropy-contrast-sigma-y-sigma-x>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-segmented-bronchial-daughter-to-parent-lumen-caliber-ratio-r-d-r-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-segmented-mammalian-bronchial-tree-specimen-junction-angle-mean>,
